# Shared source table comparison

Full BraTS 2023 GLI training set; 10,000 optimizer updates, physical batch size 4, with one distinct held-out target per sample. One batched forward/backward per update; 40,000 training samples per run. Full validation: 219 cases, one Euler step, evaluation seed 42, three conditioning modalities. Brain-masked metrics; four target modalities averaged equally. Mean ± sample SD across training seeds.

Uniform/random use the pure shared 8×4 table with normalization across only each sample's available inputs. Biased is pending and excluded. Seeds 42, 44 and 2026 run on Mostafa; seeds 43 and 45 run on Hendrix. All source/noise combinations for a given seed run on the same server.

